<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-CSL Ltd half yr net profit up 35 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-CSL Ltd half yr net profit up 35 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Dec 31 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    16.68 vs 12.90</p>
<p>    Net				     12.45 vs 9.21</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)			5.5 vs 5.0</p>
<p>NOTE: CSL Ltd is a pharmaceutical manufacturer and was formerly known as the Commonwealth Serum Laboratory.  </p>
<p>    Sales				 131.49 vs 129.05</p>
<p>    Other income			  5.30 vs 3.73</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    9.6 vs 7.1</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			 nil vs nil</p>
<p>Dividend is fully franked</p>
<p>Pay date April 28</p>
<p>Reg date April 17</p>
<p>    Tax				     4.23 vs 3.69</p>
<p>    Interest				1.34 vs 2.05</p>
<p>    Depreciation			 14.75 vs 14.55</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
